  "preserved_contracts": [
    "The existing per-bank has_* ownership and structural checks remain; bulk withdrawal reduces repeated closure/withdrawal work, not all work to strict linear complexity.",
    "Rejected cohort take moves no original transaction; original single take and partially returned cohort recovery remain supported.",
    "Imported read permissions remain owned by their original Source; Store recovery grants no replacement ready-source authority.",
    "Ordinary PhaseIo owns one original ProgramIo inventory; each of four readbacks has one PreparedReadback owner, with its original caller pool only when the prepared ownership requires one.",
    "Fixed mutable outputs borrow the original TensorView; registration preserves the previous mixed fixed/readback installation order, including valid/accept before next_id before draft_id.",
    "ProgramCarrier still atomically publishes its original Graph Invocation only after cold installation succeeds; no new runtime, owner or hot withdrawal protocol was added."
  ],
